name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-postassessment-q8_2026'

question 'Before writing any code for a new feature, a student is asked to sketch a flowchart and answer two questions: "What should this system do?" and "What should this system never do?" What SPEC principle is this practicing?'

right 'Specify — articulating intent before any AI interaction or code is written.'
wrong 'Predict — guessing what AI will produce.'
wrong 'Explain — justifying decisions about AI output.'
wrong 'Claim — identifying what you can rebuild without AI.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

